:"but as a boy he used to work in a small shop.","start":34.76,"end":38.52,"score":0.992,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-031-004","sourceId":"b2-031-004","sourceIndex":3,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,19],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"It was his job to repair bicycles and at that time he used to work fourteen hours a day.","start":39.86,"end":47.93,"score":0.984,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-031-005","sourceId":"b2-031-005","sourceIndex":4,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,16],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"He saved money for years and in 1958 he bought a small workshop of his own.","start":49.62,"end":57.44,"score":0.984,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-031-006","sourceId":"b2-031-006","sourceIndex":5,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,11],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"In his twenties Frank used to make spare parts for aeroplanes.","start":59.14,"end":64.32,"score":0.926,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-031-007","sourceId":"b2-031-007","sourceIndex":6,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,7],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"At that time he had two helpers.","start":65.87,"end":68.28,"score":0.996,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-031-008","sourceId":"b2-031-008","sourceIndex":7,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,19],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"In a few years the small workshop had become a large factory which employed seven hundred and twenty-eight people.","start":69.97,"end":78.42,"score":0.984,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-031-009","sourceId":"b2-031-009","sourceIndex":8,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,15],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Frank smiled when he remembered his hard early years and the long road to success.","start":80.1,"end":85.95,"score":0.982,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-031-010","sourceId":"b2-031-010","sourceIndex":9,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,13],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"He was still smiling when the door opened and his wife came in.","start":87.34,"end":91.45,"score":0.992,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-031-011","sourceId":"b2-031-011","sourceIndex":10,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,8],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"She wanted him to repair their grandson's bicycle!","start":92.66,"end":95.93,"score":0.946,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]}]}
